                                                "sense_id": "eb790624-ce4c-35a8-8de3-171b5c39efc0",
                                                "text": "In 2004, Gibson’s roadshow tour for The Passion of the Christ saw him visiting church groups and giving impassioned speeches about the film (which Hollywood studios refused to fund or distribute)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "615ae03a-92de-3c1a-b0bc-17001591b38f",
                                        "entry_id": "567b38d4-7143-3c47-a729-0fc3d1e2945a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A series of meetings across different cities in which executives from a company have the opportunity to talk with current or potential investors."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26424dc1-5c24-42a3-a61e-a6be1c5eb497",
                                                "sense_id": "615ae03a-92de-3c1a-b0bc-17001591b38f",
                                                "text": "I thought Equity had a pretty quick and easy way of illustrating what happens when a company decides to go public: from the pitch, to the due diligence, to the pricing, to the roadshow."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
